y do you not entrust us with Joseph while indeed, we are to him sincere counselors?","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"قَالُوا۟","translit":"۟āwُlāَq","root":"قول"},{"id":2,"arabic":"يَٰٓأَبَانَا","translit":"āَnāَbَaʾَٰٓy","root":"ابو"},{"id":3,"arabic":"مَا","translit":"āَm","root":""},{"id":4,"arabic":"لَكَ","translit":"َkَl","root":""},{"id":5,"arabic":"لَا","translit":"āَl","root":""},{"id":6,"arabic":"تَأْمَ۫نَّا","translit":"āَّnَ۫mْaʾَt","root":"امن"},{"id":7,"arabic":"عَلَىٰ","translit":"ٰàَlَʿع","root":""},{"id":8,"arabic":"يُوسُفَ","translit":"َfُswُy","root":""},{"id":9,"arabic":"وَإِنَّا","translit":"āَّnِiʾَw","root":""},{"id":10,"arabic":"لَهُۥ","translit":"ۥُhَl","root":""},{"id":11,"arabic":"لَنَٰصِحُونَ","translit":"َnwُḥِṣَٰnَl","root":"نصح"}],"hasIhya":false},{"ayah":12,"text":"أَرْسِلْهُ مَعَنَا غَدًا يَرْتَعْ وَيَلْعَبْ وَإِنَّا لَهُۥ لَحَٰفِظُونَ ","translation":"Send him with us tomorrow that he may eat well and play. And indeed, we will be his guardians.\"","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"أَرْسِلْهُ","translit":"ُhْlِsْrَaʾ","root":"رسل"},{"id":2,"arabic":"مَعَنَا","translit":"āَnَʿعَm","root":""},{"id":3,"arabic":"غَدًا","translit":"āًdَغ","root":"غدو"},{"id":4,"arabic":"يَرْتَعْ","translit":"ْʿعَtْrَy","root":"رتع"},{"id":5,"arabic":"وَيَلْعَبْ","translit":"ْbَʿعْlَyَw","root":"لعب"},{"id":6,"arabic":"وَإِنَّا","translit":"āَّnِiʾَw","root":""},{"id":7,"arabic":"لَهُۥ","translit":"ۥُhَl","root":""},{"id":8,"arabic":"لَحَٰفِظُونَ","translit":"َnwُẓِfَٰḥَl","root":"حفظ"}],"hasIhya":false},{"ayah":13,"text":"قَالَ إِنِّى لَيَحْزُنُنِىٓ أَن تَذْهَبُوا۟ بِهِۦ وَأَخَافُ أَن يَأْكُلَهُ ٱلذِّئْبُ وَأَنتُمْ عَنْهُ غَٰفِلُونَ ","translation":"[Jacob] said, \"Indeed, it saddens me that you should take him, and I fear that a wolf would eat him while you are of him unaware.\"","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"قَالَ","translit":"َlāَq","root":"قول"},{"id":2,"arabic":"إِنِّى","translit":"àِّnِiʾ","root":""},{"id":3,"arabic":"لَيَحْزُنُنِىٓ","translit":"ٓàِnُnُzْḥَyَl","root":"حزن"},{"id":4,"arabic":"أَن","translit":"nَaʾ","root":""},{"id":5,"arabic":"تَذْهَبُوا۟","translit":"۟āwُbَhْhdَt","root":"ذهب"},{"id":6,"arabic":"بِهِۦ","translit":"ۦِhِb","root":""},{"id":7,"arabic":"وَأَخَافُ","translit":"ُfāَhkَaʾَw","root":"خوف"},{"id":8,"arabic":"أَن","translit":"nَaʾ","root":""},{"id":9,"arabic":"يَأْكُلَهُ","translit":"ُhَlُkْaʾَy","root":"اكل"},{"id":10,"arabic":"ٱلذِّئْبُ","translit":"ُbْyʾِّhdlٱ","root":"ذاب"},{"id":11,"arabic":"وَأَنتُمْ","translit":"ْmُtnَaʾَw","root":""},{"id":12,"arabic":"عَنْهُ","translit":"ُhْnَʿع","root":""},{"id":13,"arabic":"غَٰفِلُونَ","translit":"َnwُlِfَٰغ","root":"غفل"}],"hasIhya":true},{"ayah":14,"text":"قَالُوا۟ لَئِنْ أَكَلَهُ ٱلذِّئْبُ وَنَحْنُ عُصْبَةٌ إِنَّآ إِذًا لَّخَٰسِرُونَ ","translation":"They said, \"If a wolf should eat him while we are a [strong] clan, indeed, we would then be losers.\"","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"قَالُوا۟","translit":"۟āwُlāَq","root":"قول"},{"id":2,"arabic":"لَئِنْ","translit":"ْnِyʾَl","root":""},{"id":3,"arabic":"أَكَلَهُ","translit":"ُhَlَkَaʾ","root":"اكل"},{"id":4,"arabic":"ٱلذِّئْبُ","translit":"ُbْyʾِّhdlٱ","root":"ذاب"},{"id":5,"arabic":"وَنَحْنُ","translit":"ُnْḥَnَw","root":""},{"id":6,"arabic":"عُصْبَةٌ","translit":"ٌẗَbْṣُʿع","root":"عصب"},{"id":7,"arabic":"إِنَّآ","translit":"ٓāَّnِiʾ","root":""},{"id":8,"arabic":"إِذًا","translit":"āًhdِiʾ","root":""},{"id":9,"arabic":"لَّخَٰسِرُونَ","translit":"َnwُrِsَٰhkَّl","root":"خسر"}],"hasIhya":false},{"ayah":15,"text":"فَلَمَّا ذَهَبُوا۟ بِهِۦ وَأَجْمَعُوٓا۟ أَن يَجْعَلُوهُ فِى غَيَٰبَتِ ٱلْجُبِّۚ وَأَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْهِ لَتُنَبِّئَنَّهُم بِأَمْرِهِمْ هَٰذَا وَهُمْ لَا يَشْعُرُونَ ","translation":"So when they took him [out] and agreed to put him into the bottom of the well...[1] But We inspired to him, \"You will surely inform them [someday] about this affair of theirs while they do not perceive [your identity].\"","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"فَلَمَّا","translit":"āَّmَlَf","root":""},{"id":2,"arabic":"ذَهَبُوا۟","translit":"۟āwُbَhَhd","root":"ذهب"},{"id":3,"arabic":"بِهِۦ","translit":"ۦِhِb","root":""},{"id":4,"arabic":"وَأَجْمَعُوٓا۟","translit":"۟āٓwُʿعَmْjgَaʾَw","root":"جمع"},{"id":5,"arabic":"أَن","translit":"nَaʾ","root":""},{"id":6,"arabic":"يَجْعَلُوهُ","translit":"ُhwُlَʿعْjgَy","root":"جعل"},{"id":7,"arabic":"فِى","translit":"àِf","root":""},{"id":8,"arabic":"غَيَٰبَتِ","translit":"ِtَbَٰyَغ","root":"غيب"},{"id":9,"arabic":"ٱلْجُبِّ","translit":"ِّbُjgْlٱ","root":"جبب"},{"id":10,"arabic":"وَأَوْحَيْنَآ","translit":"ٓāَnْyَḥْwَaʾَw","root":"وحي"},{"id":11,"arabic":"إِلَيْهِ","translit":"ِhْyَlِiʾ","root":""},{"id":12,"arabic":"لَتُنَبِّئَنَّهُم","translit":"mُhَّnَyʾِّbَnُtَl","root":"نبا"},{"id":13,"arabic":"بِأَمْرِهِمْ","translit":"ْmِhِrْmَaʾِb","root":"امر"},{"id":14,"arabic":"هَٰذَا","translit":"āَhdَٰh","root":""},{"id":15,"arabic":"وَهُمْ","translit":"ْmُhَw","root":""},{"id":16,"arabic":"لَا","translit":"āَl","root":""},{"id":17,"arabic":"يَشْعُرُونَ","translit":"َnwُrُʿعْhsَy","root":"شعر"}],"hasIhya":false},{"ayah":16,"text":"وَجَآءُوٓ أَبَاهُمْ عِشَآءً يَبْكُونَ ","translation":"And they came to their father at night, weeping.","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"وَجَآءُوٓ","translit":"ٓwُءٓāَjgَw","root":"جيا"},{"id":2,"arabic":"أَبَاهُمْ","translit":"ْmُhāَbَaʾ","root":"ابو"},{"id":3,"arabic":"عِشَآءً","translit":"ًءٓāَhsِʿع","root":"عشو"},{"id":4,"arabic":"يَبْكُونَ","translit":"َnwُkْbَy","root":"بكي"}],"hasIhya":false},{"ayah":17,"text":"قَالُوا۟ يَٰٓأَبَانَآ إِنَّا ذَهَبْنَا نَسْتَبِقُ وَتَرَكْنَا يُوسُفَ عِندَ مَتَٰعِنَا فَأَكَلَهُ ٱلذِّئْبُۖ وَمَآ أَنتَ بِمُؤْمِنٍ لَّنَا وَلَوْ كُنَّا صَٰدِقِينَ ","translation":"They said, \"O our father, indeed we went racing each other and left Joseph with our possessions, and a wolf ate him. But you would not believe us, even if we were truthful.\"","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"قَالُوا۟","translit":"۟āwُlāَq","root":"قول"},{"id":2,"arabic":"يَٰٓأَبَانَآ","translit":"ٓāَnāَbَaʾَٰٓy","root":"ابو"},{"id":3,"arabi