ard the doers of good.","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"وَلَمَّا","translit":"āَّmَlَw","root":""},{"id":2,"arabic":"بَلَغَ","translit":"َغَlَb","root":"بلغ"},{"id":3,"arabic":"أَشُدَّهُۥٓ","translit":"ٓۥُhَّdُhsَaʾ","root":"شدد"},{"id":4,"arabic":"ءَاتَيْنَٰهُ","translit":"ُhَٰnْyَtāَء","root":"اتي"},{"id":5,"arabic":"حُكْمًا","translit":"āًmْkُḥ","root":"حكم"},{"id":6,"arabic":"وَعِلْمًا","translit":"āًmْlِʿعَw","root":"علم"},{"id":7,"arabic":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","translit":"َkِlَٰhdَkَw","root":""},{"id":8,"arabic":"نَجْزِى","translit":"àِzْjgَn","root":"جزي"},{"id":9,"arabic":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","translit":"َnyِnِsْḥُmْlٱ","root":"حسن"}],"hasIhya":false},{"ayah":23,"text":"وَرَٰوَدَتْهُ ٱلَّتِى هُوَ فِى بَيْتِهَا عَن نَّفْسِهِۦ وَغَلَّقَتِ ٱلْأَبْوَٰبَ وَقَالَتْ هَيْتَ لَكَۚ قَالَ مَعَاذَ ٱللَّهِۖ إِنَّهُۥ رَبِّىٓ أَحْسَنَ مَثْوَاىَۖ إِنَّهُۥ لَا يُفْلِحُ ٱلظَّٰلِمُونَ ","translation":"And she, in whose house he was, sought to seduce him. She closed the doors and said, \"Come, you.\" He said, \"[I seek] the refuge of Allāh. Indeed, he[1] is my master, who has made good my residence. Indeed, wrongdoers will not succeed.\"","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"وَرَٰوَدَتْهُ","translit":"ُhْtَdَwَٰrَw","root":"رود"},{"id":2,"arabic":"ٱلَّتِى","translit":"àِtَّlٱ","root":""},{"id":3,"arabic":"هُوَ","translit":"َwُh","root":""},{"id":4,"arabic":"فِى","translit":"àِf","root":""},{"id":5,"arabic":"بَيْتِهَا","translit":"āَhِtْyَb","root":"بيت"},{"id":6,"arabic":"عَن","translit":"nَʿع","root":""},{"id":7,"arabic":"نَّفْسِهِۦ","translit":"ۦِhِsْfَّn","root":"نفس"},{"id":8,"arabic":"وَغَلَّقَتِ","translit":"ِtَqَّlَغَw","root":"غلق"},{"id":9,"arabic":"ٱلْأَبْوَٰبَ","translit":"َbَٰwْbَaʾْlٱ","root":"بوب"},{"id":10,"arabic":"وَقَالَتْ","translit":"ْtَlāَqَw","root":"قول"},{"id":11,"arabic":"هَيْتَ","translit":"َtْyَh","root":"هيت"},{"id":12,"arabic":"لَكَ","translit":"َkَl","root":""},{"id":13,"arabic":"قَالَ","translit":"َlāَq","root":"قول"},{"id":14,"arabic":"مَعَاذَ","translit":"َhdāَʿعَm","root":"عوذ"},{"id":15,"arabic":"ٱللَّهِ","translit":"ِhَّllٱ","root":"اله"},{"id":16,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ","translit":"ۥُhَّnِiʾ","root":""},{"id":17,"arabic":"رَبِّىٓ","translit":"ٓàِّbَr","root":"ربب"},{"id":18,"arabic":"أَحْسَنَ","translit":"َnَsْḥَaʾ","root":"حسن"},{"id":19,"arabic":"مَثْوَاىَ","translit":"َàāَwْhtَm","root":"ثوي"},{"id":20,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ","translit":"ۥُhَّnِiʾ","root":""},{"id":21,"arabic":"لَا","translit":"āَl","root":""},{"id":22,"arabic":"يُفْلِحُ","translit":"ُḥِlْfُy","root":"فلح"},{"id":23,"arabic":"ٱلظَّٰلِمُونَ","translit":"َnwُmِlَّٰẓlٱ","root":"ظلم"}],"hasIhya":true},{"ayah":24,"text":"وَلَقَدْ هَمَّتْ بِهِۦۖ وَهَمَّ بِهَا لَوْلَآ أَن رَّءَا بُرْهَٰنَ رَبِّهِۦۚ كَذَٰلِكَ لِنَصْرِفَ عَنْهُ ٱلسُّوٓءَ وَٱلْفَحْشَآءَۚ إِنَّهُۥ مِنْ عِبَادِنَا ٱلْمُخْلَصِينَ ","translation":"And she certainly determined [to seduce] him, and he would have inclined to her had he not seen the proof [i.e., sign] of his Lord. And thus [it was] that We should avert from him evil and immorality. Indeed, he was of Our chosen servants.","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"وَلَقَدْ","translit":"ْdَqَlَw","root":""},{"id":2,"arabic":"هَمَّتْ","translit":"ْtَّmَh","root":"همم"},{"id":3,"arabic":"بِهِۦ","translit":"ۦِhِb","root":""},{"id":4,"arabic":"وَهَمَّ","translit":"َّmَhَw","root":"همم"},{"id":5,"arabic":"بِهَا","translit":"āَhِb","root":""},{"id":6,"arabic":"لَوْلَآ","translit":"ٓāَlْwَl","root":""},{"id":7,"arabic":"أَن","translit":"nَaʾ","root":""},{"id":8,"arabic":"رَّءَا","translit":"āَءَّr","root":"راي"},{"id":9,"arabic":"بُرْهَٰنَ","translit":"َnَٰhْrُb","root":"برهن"},{"id":10,"arabic":"رَبِّهِۦ","translit":"ۦِhِّbَr","root":"ربب"},{"id":11,"arabic":"كَذَٰلِكَ","translit":"َkِlَٰhdَk","root":""},{"id":12,"arabic":"لِنَصْرِفَ","translit":"َfِrْṣَnِl","root":"صرف"},{"id":13,"arabic":"عَنْهُ","translit":"ُhْnَʿع","root":""},{"id":14,"arabic":"ٱلسُّوٓءَ","translit":"َءٓwُّslٱ","root":"سوا"},{"id":15,"arabic":"وَٱلْفَحْشَآءَ","translit":"َءٓāَhsْḥَfْlٱَw","root":"فحش"},{"id":16,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ","translit":"ۥُhَّnِiʾ","root":""},{"id":17,"arabic":"مِنْ","translit":"ْnِm","root":""},{"id":18,"arabic":"عِبَادِنَا","translit":"āَnِdāَbِʿع","root":"عبد"},{"id":19,"arabic":"ٱلْمُخْلَصِينَ","translit":"َnyِṣَlْhkُmْlٱ","root":"خلص"}],"hasIhya":true},{"ayah":25,"text":"وَٱسْتَبَقَا ٱلْبَابَ وَقَدَّتْ قَمِيصَهُۥ مِن دُبُرٍ وَأَلْفَيَا سَيِّدَهَا لَدَا ٱلْبَابِۚ قَالَتْ مَا جَزَآءُ مَنْ أَرَادَ بِأَهْلِكَ سُوٓءًا إِلَّآ أَن يُسْجَنَ أَوْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ ","translation":"And they both raced to the door, and she tore his shirt from the back, and they found her husband at the door. She said, \"What is the recompense of one who intended evil for your wife but that he be imprisoned or a painful punishment?\"","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"وَٱسْتَبَقَا","translit":"āَqَbَtْsٱَw","root":"سبق"},{"id":2,"arabic":"ٱلْبَابَ","translit":"َbāَbْlٱ","root":"بوب"},{"id":3,"arabic":"وَقَدَّتْ","translit":"ْtَّdَqَw","root":"قدد"},{"id":4,"arabic":"قَمِيصَهُۥ","translit":"ۥُhَṣyِmَq","root":"قمص"},{"id":5,"arabic":"مِن","translit":"nِm","root":""},{"id":6,"arabic":"دُبُرٍ","translit":"ٍrُbُd","root":"دبر"},{"id":7,"arabic":"وَأَلْفَيَا","translit":"āَyَfْlَaʾَw","root":"لفو"},{"id":8,"arabic":"سَيِّدَهَا","translit":"āَhَdِّyَs","root":"سود"},{"id":9,"arabic":"لَدَا","translit":"āَdَl","root":""},{"id":10,"arabic":"ٱلْبَابِ","translit":"ِbāَbْlٱ","root":"بوب"},{"id":11,"arabic":"قَالَتْ","translit":"ْtَlāَq","root":"قول"},{"id":12,"arabic":"مَا","translit":"āَm","root":""},{"id":13,"arabic":"جَزَآءُ","translit":"ُءٓāَzَjg","root":"جزي"},{"id":14,"arabic":"مَنْ","translit":"ْnَm","root":""},{"id":15,"arabic":"أَرَادَ","translit":"َdāَrَaʾ","root":"رود"},{"id":16,"arabic":"بِأَهْلِكَ","translit":"َkِlْhَaʾِb","root":"اهل"},{"id":17,"arabic":"سُوٓءًا","translit":"āًءٓwُs","root":"سوا"},{"id":18,"arabic":"إِلَّآ","translit":"ٓāَّlِiʾ","root":""},{"id":19,"arabic":"أَن","translit":"nَaʾ","root":""},{"id":20,"arabic":"يُسْجَنَ","translit":"َnَjgْsُy","root":"سجن"},{"id":21,"arabic":"أَوْ","translit":"ْwَaʾ","root":""},{"id":22,"arabic":"عَذَابٌ","translit":"ٌbāَhdَʿع","root":"عذب"},{"id":23,"arabic":"أَلِيمٌ","translit":"ٌmyِlَaʾ","root":"الم"}],"hasIhya":true},{"ayah":26,"text":"قَالَ هِىَ رَٰوَدَتْنِى عَن نَّفْسِىۚ وَشَهِدَ شَاهِدٌ مِّنْ أَهْلِهَآ إِن كَانَ قَمِيصُهُۥ قُدَّ مِن قُبُلٍ فَصَدَقَتْ وَهُوَ مِنَ ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ ","translation":"[Joseph] said, \"It was she who sought to seduce me.\" And a witness from her family testified, \"If his shirt is torn from the front, then she has told the truth, and he is of the liars.","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"قَالَ","translit":"َlāَq","root":"قول"},{"id":2,"arabic":"هِىَ","translit":"َàِh","root":""},{"id":3,"arabic":"رَٰوَدَتْنِى","translit":"àِnْtَdَwَٰr","root":"رود"},{"id":4,"arabic":"عَن","translit":"nَʿع","root":""},{"id":5,"arabic":"نَّفْسِى","translit":"àِsْfَّn","root":"نفس"},{"id":6,"arabic":"وَشَهِدَ","translit":"َdِhَhsَw","root":"شهد"},{"id":7,"arabic":"شَاهِدٌ","translit":"ٌdِhāَhs","root":"شهد"},{"id":8,"arabic":"مِّنْ","translit":"ْnِّm","root":""},{"id":9,"arabic":"أَهْلِهَآ","translit":"ٓāَhِlْhَaʾ","root":"اهل"},{"id":10,"arabic":"إِن","translit":"nِiʾ","root":""},{"id":11,"arabic":"كَانَ","translit":"َnāَk","root":"كون"},{"id":12,"arabic":"قَمِيصُهُۥ","translit":"ۥُhُṣyِmَq","root":"قمص"},{"id":13,"arabic":"قُدَّ","translit":"َّdُq","root":"قدد"},{"id":14,"arabic":"مِن","translit":"nِm","root":""},{"id":15,"arabic":"قُبُلٍ","translit":"ٍlُbُq","root":"قبل"},{"id":16,"arabic":"فَصَدَقَتْ","translit":"ْtَqَdَṣَf","root":"صدق"},{"id":17,"arabic":"وَهُوَ","translit":"َwُhَw","root":""},{"id":18,"arabic":"مِنَ","translit":"َnِm","root":""},{"id":19,"arabic":"ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ","translit":"َnyِbِhdَٰkْlٱ","root":"كذب"}],"hasIhya":false},{"ayah":27,"text":"وَإِن كَانَ قَمِيصُهُۥ قُدَّ مِن دُبُرٍ فَكَذَبَتْ وَهُوَ مِنَ ٱلصَّٰدِقِينَ ","translation":"But if his shirt is torn from the back, then she has lied, and he is of the truthful.\"","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"وَإِن","translit":"nِiʾَw","root":""},{"id":2,"arabic":"كَانَ","translit":"َnāَk","root":"كون"},{"id":3,"arabic":"قَمِيصُهُۥ","translit":"ۥُhُṣyِmَq","root":"قمص"},{"id":4,"arabic":"قُدَّ","translit":"َّdُq","root":"قدد"},{"id":5,"arabic":"مِن","translit":"nِm","root":""},{"id":6,"arabic":"دُبُرٍ","translit":"ٍrُbُd","root":"دبر"},{"id":7,"arabic":"فَكَذَبَتْ","translit":"ْtَbَhdَkَf","root":"كذب"},{"id":8,"arabic":"وَهُوَ","translit":"َwُhَw","root":""},{"id":9,"arabic":"مِنَ","translit":"َnِm","root":""},{"id":10,"arabic":"ٱلصَّٰدِقِينَ","translit":"َnyِqِdَّٰṣlٱ","root":"صدق"}],"hasIhya":false},{"ayah":28,"text":"فَلَمَّا رَءَا قَمِيصَهُۥ قُدَّ مِن دُبُرٍ قَالَ إِنَّهُۥ مِن كَيْدِكُنَّۖ إِنَّ كَيْدَكُنَّ عَظِيمٌ ","translation":"So when he [i.e., her husband] saw his shirt torn from the back, he said, \"Indeed, it is of your [i.e., women's] plan. Indeed, your plan is great [i.e., vehement].","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"فَلَمَّا","translit":"āَّmَlَf","root":""},{"id":2,"arabic":"رَءَا","translit":"āَءَr","root":"راي"},{"id":3,"arabic":"قَمِيصَهُۥ","translit":"ۥُhَṣyِmَq","root":"قمص"},{"id":4,"arabic":"قُدَّ","translit":"َّdُq","root":"قدد"},{"id":5,"arabic":"مِن","translit":"nِm","root":""},{"id":6,"arabic":"دُبُرٍ","translit":"ٍrُbُd","root":"دبر"},{"id":7,"arabic":"قَالَ","translit":"َlāَq","root":"قول"},{"id":8,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ","translit":"ۥُhَّnِiʾ","root":""},{"id":9,"arabic":"مِن","translit":"nِm","root":""},{"id":10,"arabic":"كَيْدِكُنَّ","translit":"َّnُkِdْyَk","root":"كيد"},{"id":11,"arabic":"إِنَّ","translit":"َّnِiʾ","root":""},{"id":12,"arabic":"كَيْدَكُنَّ","translit":"َّnُkَdْyَk","root":"كيد"},{"id":13,"arabic":"عَظِيمٌ","translit":"ٌmyِẓَʿع","root":"عظم"}],"hasIhya":false},{"ayah":29,"text":"يُوسُفُ أَعْرِضْ عَنْ هَٰذَاۚ وَٱسْتَغْفِرِى لِذَنۢبِكِۖ إِنَّكِ كُنتِ مِنَ ٱلْخَاطِـِٔينَ ","translation":"Joseph, ignore this.[1] And, [my wife], ask forgiveness for your sin. Indeed, you were of the sinful.\"","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"يُوسُفُ","translit":"ُfُswُy","root":""},{"id":2,"arabic":"أَعْرِضْ","translit":"ْḍِrْʿعَaʾ","root":"عرض"},{"id":3,"arabic":"عَنْ","translit":"ْnَʿع","root":""},{"id":4,"arabic":"هَٰذَا","translit":"āَhdَٰh","root":""},{"id":5,"arabic":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرِى","translit":"àِrِfْغَtْsٱَw","root":"غفر"},{"id":6,"arabic":"لِذَنۢبِكِ","translit":"ِkِbۢnَhdِl","root":"ذنب"},{"id":7,"arabic":"إِنَّكِ","translit":"ِkَّnِiʾ","root":""},{"id":8,"arabic":"كُنتِ","translit":"ِtnُk","root":"كون"},{"id":9,"arabic":"مِنَ","translit":"َnِm","root":""},{"id":10,"arabic":"ٱلْخَاطِـِٔينَ","translit":"َnyِٔـِṭāَhkْlٱ","root":"خطا"}],"hasIhya":false},{"ayah":30,"text":"وَقَالَ نِسْوَةٌ فِى ٱلْمَدِينَةِ ٱمْرَأَتُ ٱلْعَزِيزِ تُرَٰوِدُ فَتَىٰهَا عَن نَّفْسِهِۦۖ قَدْ شَغَفَهَا حُبًّاۖ إِنَّا لَنَرَىٰهَا فِى ضَلَٰلٍ مُّبِينٍ ","translation":"And women in the city said, \"The wife of al-ʿAzeez is seeking to seduce her slave boy; he has impassioned her with love. Indeed, we see her [to be] in clear error.\"","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"وَقَالَ","translit":"َlāَqَw","root":"قول"},{"id":2,"arabic":"نِسْوَةٌ","translit":"ٌẗَwْsِn","root":"نسو"},{"id":3,"arabic":"فِى","translit":"àِf","root":""},{"id":4,"arabic":"ٱلْمَدِينَةِ","translit":"ِẗَnyِdَmْlٱ","root":"مدن"},{"id":5,"arabic":"ٱمْرَأَتُ","translit":"ُtَaʾَrْmٱ","root":"مرا"},{"id":6,"arabic":"ٱلْعَزِيزِ","translit":"ِzyِzَʿعْlٱ","root":"عزز"},{"id":7,"arabic":"تُرَٰوِدُ","translit":"ُdِwَٰrُt","root":"رود"},{"id":8,"arabic":"فَتَىٰهَا","translit":"āَhٰàَtَf","root":"فتي"},{"id":9,"arabic":"عَن","translit":"nَʿع","root":""},{"id":10,"arabic":"نَّفْسِهِۦ","translit":"ۦِhِsْfَّn","root":"نفس"},{"id":11,"arabic":"قَدْ","translit":"ْdَq","root":""},{"id":12,"arabic":"شَغَفَهَا","translit":"āَhَfَغَhs","root":"شغف"},{"id":13,"arabic":"حُبًّا","translit":"āًّbُḥ","root":"حبب"},{"id":14,"arabic":"إِنَّا","translit":"āَّnِiʾ","root":""},{"id":15,"arabic":"لَنَرَىٰهَا","translit":"āَhٰàَrَnَl","root":"راي"},{"id":16,"arabic":"فِى","translit":"àِf","root":""},{"id":17,"arabic":"ضَلَٰلٍ","translit":"ٍlَٰlَḍ","root":"ضلل"},{"id":18,"arabic":"مُّبِينٍ","translit":"ٍnyِbُّm","root":"بين"}],"hasIhya":false},{"ayah":31,"text":"فَلَمَّا سَمِعَتْ بِمَكْرِهِنَّ أَرْسَلَتْ إِلَيْهِنَّ وَأَعْتَدَتْ لَهُنَّ مُتَّكَـًٔا وَءَاتَتْ كُلَّ وَٰحِدَةٍ مِّنْهُنَّ سِكِّينًا وَقَالَتِ ٱخْرُجْ عَلَيْهِنَّۖ فَلَمَّا رَأَيْنَهُۥٓ أَكْبَرْنَهُۥ وَقَطَّعْنَ أَيْدِيَهُنَّ وَقُلْنَ حَٰشَ لِلَّهِ مَا هَٰذَا بَشَرًا إِنْ هَٰذَآ إِلَّا مَلَكٌ كَرِيمٌ ","translation":"So when she heard of their scheming, she sent for them and prepared for them a banquet and gave each one of them a knife and said [to Joseph], \"Come out before them.\" And when they saw him, they greatly admired him and cut their hands[1] and said, \"Perfect is Allāh![2] This is not a man; this is none but a noble angel.\"","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"فَلَمَّا","translit":"āَّmَlَf","root":""},{"id":2,"arabic":"سَمِعَتْ","translit":"ْtَʿعِmَs","root":"سمع"},{"id":3,"arabic":"بِمَكْرِهِنَّ","translit":"َّnِhِrْkَmِb","root":"مكر"},{"id":4,"arabic":"أَرْسَلَتْ","translit":"ْtَlَsْrَaʾ","root":"رسل"},{"id":5,"arabic":"إِلَيْهِنَّ","translit":"َّnِhْyَlِiʾ","root":""},{"id":6,"arabic":"وَأَعْتَدَتْ","translit":"ْtَdَtْʿعَaʾَw","root":"عتد"},{"id":7,"arabic":"لَهُنَّ","translit":"َّnُhَl","root":""},{"id":8,"arabic":"مُتَّكَـًٔا","translit":"āًٔـَkَّtُm","root":"وكا"},{"id":9,"arabic":"وَءَاتَتْ","translit":"ْtَtāَءَw","root":"اتي"},{"id":10,"arabic":"كُلَّ","translit":"َّlُk","root":"كلل"},{"id":11,"arabic":"وَٰحِدَةٍ","translit":"ٍẗَdِḥَٰw","root":"وحد"},{"id":12,"arabic":"مِّنْهُنَّ","translit":"َّnُhْnِّm","root":""},{"id":13,"arabic":"سِكِّينًا","translit":"āًnyِّkِs","root":"سكن"},{"id":14,"arabic":"وَقَالَتِ","translit":"ِtَlāَqَw","root":"قول"},{"id":15,"arabic":"ٱخْرُجْ","translit":"ْjgُrْhkٱ","root":"خرج"},{"id":16,"arabic":"عَلَيْهِنَّ","translit":"َّnِhْyَlَʿع","root":""},{"id":17,"arabic":"فَلَمَّا","translit":"āَّmَlَf","root":""},{"id":18,"arabic":"رَأَيْنَهُۥٓ","translit":"ٓۥُhَnْyَaʾَr","roo